 that will have severe consequences  um uh nato allies  uh have also provided some support to  ukraine  to help protect against chemical and  biological warfare protective equipment  equipment to detect and identify a  chemical attack  but on the likelihood i'm not speculate  i will only say that any use of chemical  weapons will be absolutely unacceptable
 

